error[V0214]: async functions cannot call each other in a cycle: `ping` calls `pong`, which calls `ping`
 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0214_async_cycle/main.vr:5:5
  |
5 |     pong(n - 1).await
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^ async functions cannot call each other in a cycle: `ping` calls `pong`, which calls `ping`
  |
  = note: an async function's waiting is planned out before it runs, which cannot be done for one that waits on itself; make one of them an ordinary function, or use a loop
  = note: in Rust terms, the future would contain itself and have no fixed size
